OL,3,GNEWSASecurity improvements made at
OL,4,Amental health unit after student's
OL,5,Adeath
OL,6,
OL,7,FSecurity improvements have been made at
OL,8,Fa mental health unit in the years since
OL,9,Fthe death of a student who escaped
OL,10,Fthrough a window in 1994.
OL,12,FAnthony Whittle, who was suffering from
OL,13,Fparanoid schizophrenia, had been taken
OL,14,Fto the Hergest psychiatric unit at
OL,15,FYsbyty Gwynedd in Bangor but fled and
OL,16,Fwas later found dead.
OL,18,FA fresh inquest was held this week
OL,19,Fafter the high court ruled that the
OL,20,Foriginal hearing in 1995 was
OL,21,Finadequate.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
