OL,3,GNEWSASecurity improvements made at
OL,4,Amental health unit after student's
OL,5,Adeath
OL,6,
OL,7,FA jury concluded Anthony, 30, died by
OL,8,Fmisadventure after suffering an acute
OL,9,Fmental health episode, undergoing an
OL,10,Fassessment and leaving the unit through
OL,11,Fwhat was believed to be a secure
OL,12,Fwindow.
